#X msg 110 743 @div;
#X text 245 743 Get/Set beat subdivision. Type: int. Default value:
1\. Range: 1\...64\.;
#X msg 110 785 @dur;
#X text 245 785 Get/Set whole sequence duration. (Recalculates @t property
