0\.;
#X msg 110 842 @inf;
#X text 245 842 Alias to @r -1 \, repeats infinitely.;
#X msg 110 872 @length;
#X text 245 872 Get/Set event length. In case of float or float wuth
'ms' suffix - event length is fixed for any event duration. In case
of V% - @length expected to be in 0\..100 range and event length is
percent of duration. In case of negative @length event duration is
calculated as duration+@length \, but not less then 1\. Type: float.
Default value: 75\.;
#X msg 110 975 @mode;
#X text 245 975 Get/Set sequencer mode. 'inc': from first to last \,
'dec': from last to first \, 'tri': from first to last \, then back.
Type: symbol. Default value: inc. Allowed values: inc \, dec \, tri.;
#X msg 110 1047 @once;
#X text 245 1047 Alias to @r 1 \, play once.;
#X msg 110 1077 @p;
#X text 245 1077 Get/Set sequencer pattern in beat duration units.
Type: list.;
#X msg 110 1107 @r;
#X text 245 1107 Get/Set number of whole sequence repeats. If -1: repeat
infinitely. Type: int. Default value: 1\. Min value: -1\.;
#X msg 110 1149 @t;
#X text 245 1149 Get/Set time between beats. Unit values like 100ms
